media-herkunft-text =
    Origin of the character sets in this folder
    ===========================================

    These files are the own default character sets "VC-Standard" of VintageCoder.
    Author: the VintageCoder project. License: CC0-1.0 (public domain, free to pass on, also in your own programs).
    No original ROMs and no replicas of original characters were used.
    The design follows the rules of the style sheet and was approved by the project owner. For simple shapes in an 8x8 grid (brackets, period, comma, dash, colon, I family, line and frame characters), similarities with other character sets are caused by function; a local distance check found small distances for a few such characters, and the project owner approved the sets anyway. This is not a legal statement.

